{
  "info": {
    "name": "School Management API",
    "description": "Postman collection for School Management API.\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:5000`\n\n## APIs\n1. **POST /addSchool** - Add a new school\n2. **GET /listSchools** - List schools sorted by proximity\n\n## Setup\n- Make sure the server is running: `npx nodemon`\n- Select the `School Management API` environment before testing",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Add School",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add School - Success",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Delhi Public School\",\n  \"address\": \"Mathura Road, New Delhi\",\n  \"latitude\": 28.6139,\n  \"longitude\": 77.2090\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addSchool",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addSchool"]
            },
            "description": "Adds a new school to the database.\n\n**Request Body:**\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| name | string | ✅ | School name |\n| address | string | ✅ | School address |\n| latitude | float | ✅ | Geographic latitude |\n| longitude | float | ✅ | Geographic longitude |\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"School added successfully\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - School Added Successfully",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"School added successfully\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Delhi Public School\",\n  \"address\": \"Mathura Road, New Delhi\",\n  \"latitude\": 28.6139,\n  \"longitude\": 77.2090\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addSchool",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["addSchool"]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
