    {
      "name": "List Schools",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Schools - Success",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/listSchools?latitude=28.6139&longitude=77.2090",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["listSchools"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "latitude",
                  "value": "28.6139",
                  "description": "Your current latitude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "longitude",
                  "value": "77.2090",
                  "description": "Your current longitude"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns all schools sorted by distance from the provided coordinates.\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |\n|-----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| latitude | float | ✅ | User's current latitude |\n| longitude | float | ✅ | User's current longitude |\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Schools retrieved successfully\",\n  \"schools\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Delhi Public School\",\n      \"address\": \"Mathura Road, New Delhi\",\n      \"latitude\": 28.6139,\n      \"longitude\": 77.209,\n      \"distance\": 0\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
